{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602290/extras/wishlist_english.gif?t=1745315933\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602290/extras/Wishlist_Campaign_EN1.png?t=1745315933\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Welcome to the College of Magical Arts, an institution where you either unlock your magical potential or... end up in a 9 \u00be dorm.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After failing all of your entrance exams and being exiled from home, you have no hope left. But an unexpected letter from a mysterious college gives you one last chance at a new life. Except there's just one problem: you have no magic. None at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After failing a test for magical abilities, you find yourself among the strangest students on campus. And on your first night, you're &quot;attacked&quot; by Lucy, an incubus who wants to get a taste of the fresh blood.... When you cum, Lucy's magical power overflows and he transforms from the excess power...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's then that you find out that you have a rare gift: you're an Amplifier, able to amplify other people's magic. Now you're the object of attention, which means you'll have to juggle school, work, and social interactions to avoid getting kicked out of college.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Life simulator set in a magical dormitory - make friends, make enemies, get involved in crazy adventures. Colorful characters, exciting plot, funny dialogues and hot sex scenes. All this is waiting for you in <strong>FEMBOY FUTA HOUSE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602290/extras/decor1_english.png?t=1745315933\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete daily tasks (can something terrible happen if you don't do them?...)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A calendar packed with events - each day brings new challenges, unexpected encounters and plot twists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mini-games and activities - study, pass magic tests, participate in activities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore campus - secret rooms, quirky teachers and strange neighbors are waiting for you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your power is someone else's magic - help (or hinder) others using your unique ability</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3602290?t=1745315933","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3602290?t=1745315933","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602290/b83fd60af8610864bd9db22913cede85083bfb30/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745315933","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602290/b83fd60af8610864bd9db22913cede85083bfb30/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745315933","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"All characters in the game are adults. The game contains adult content including nudity and NSFW content. The game contains some profanity.\r\n\r\nThe game features nude girl and animated H-scenes. The game contains adult material and scenes of a sexual nature. All sex in the game is consensual. The game contains femboy and futanari characters, monstergirls."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602290/extras/wishlist_english.gif?t=1745315933\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602290/extras/Wishlist_Campaign_EN1.png?t=1745315933\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Welcome to the College of Magical Arts, an institution where you either unlock your magical potential or... end up in a 9 \u00be dorm.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After failing all of your entrance exams and being exiled from home, you have no hope left. But an unexpected letter from a mysterious college gives you one last chance at a new life. Except there's just one problem: you have no magic. None at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After failing a test for magical abilities, you find yourself among the strangest students on campus. And on your first night, you're &quot;attacked&quot; by Lucy, an incubus who wants to get a taste of the fresh blood.... When you cum, Lucy's magical power overflows and he transforms from the excess power...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's then that you find out that you have a rare gift: you're an Amplifier, able to amplify other people's magic. Now you're the object of attention, which means you'll have to juggle school, work, and social interactions to avoid getting kicked out of college.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Life simulator set in a magical dormitory - make friends, make enemies, get involved in crazy adventures. Colorful characters, exciting plot, funny dialogues and hot sex scenes. All this is waiting for you in <strong>FEMBOY FUTA HOUSE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602290/extras/decor1_english.png?t=1745315933\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete daily tasks (can something terrible happen if you don't do them?...)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A calendar packed with events - each day brings new challenges, unexpected encounters and plot twists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mini-games and activities - study, pass magic tests, participate in activities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore campus - secret rooms, quirky teachers and strange neighbors are waiting for you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your power is someone else's magic - help (or hinder) others using your unique ability</p></li></ul>","developers":["IT'S A TRAP"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602290/c7a056be52e5cb5d0331c25b47a45830c61b92d5/header.jpg?t=1745315933","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257119290,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119290/movie480.mp4?t=1743162694","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119290/movie_max.mp4?t=1743162694"},"name":"Teaser Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257119290/cacd1a8a654bbc93991a970a61467779f4b9a6d4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743162694","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119290/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743162694","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119290/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743162694"}}],"name":"FEMBOY FUTA HOUSE","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later (x64)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2,0 GHz Core 2 Duo<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 